All distribution of Covered Software in Source Code Form, including any Modifications that You create or to which You contribute, must be under the terms of this License. You must inform recipients that the Source Code Form is governed by this License, and how they can obtain a copy of this License. You may not attempt to alter, restrict, or attach conditions to the rights granted to You under this License.

